  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: jackson-dataformat-avro 2.10.0.rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat:jackson-dataformat-avro 2.10.0.rhlw-00001 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2020-28491: This affects the package com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat:jackson-dataformat-cbor from 0 and before 2.11.4, from 2.12.0-rc1 and before 2.12.1. Unchecked allocation of byte buffer can cause a java.lang.OutOfMemoryError exception.\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat:jackson-dataformat-avro 2.10.0 from Maven Central.",
